# React / HTML

Follow `agents/docs/react-html.md`. Hub: `AGENTS.md`.

- Static `import` only; do not `npm run build` (React: performRollup then npc)
- Use Promise polyfills from `@helpers/promisePolyfill.js`
- Memoize Context/child callbacks with `useCallback`; AppContext with `useMemo`
- Use `DynamicDialog` (handlers in `useCallback`)
